{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32133","headline":"雍台歌 · 温庭筠","name":"雍台歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太子池南楼百尺，入窓新树疎帘隔。\n黄金铺首画钩陈，羽葆停幢拂交戟。\n盘纡阑楯临高台，帐殿临流鸾扇开。\n早鴈惊鸣细波起，映花卤簿龙飞回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}